{"id":"wb-7-1019","name":"世德堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"世德堂","text":"世德堂位于浙江省金华市兰溪市黄店镇三泉村，又名“将士厅”。始建于南宋年间，现存三进建筑为明、清年间重建，面阔均为三间，面南向，总占地面积710平方米。第一进为牌坊式砖雕门楼，建于明嘉靖年间。第二进为正厅。第三进为清末民初时增建。1997年8月29日公布为浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E5%BE%B7%E5%A0%82","revisionId":90056478,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90056478","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e68dde48d0d4175048d97ff2.jpg","title":"Lanxi_Sanquan_2025.10.17_16-25-52.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lanxi_Sanquan_2025.10.17_16-25-52.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/61/Lanxi_Sanquan_2025.10.17_16-25-52.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​世德堂享堂","width":320,"height":240}}